Description: "Verifies that user-built extensions inside ~/.pi/agent/extensions continue to load, type-check, and behave correctly after a pi update (new version under ~/.pi/agent/install/releases). Use whenever pi has been updated/upgraded and the user asks whether extensions are affected, or right after running pi update / a new release appears."

